    "method_description": "New M2 Falcon runtime that executes a 3.54M-parameter causal Transformer (shared set frontend, 4-layer temporal stack, 256-128-2 readout), not the old static SPINT decoder. Weights are the seed-42 S1-SMALL-COS EMA view at epoch 19, selected by a sealed visible-product rule on local M33-disjoint ext-4 (equal-session mean 0.4515). Per-session banks reuse the training-time native E0 and MOVE-T4 (bins 5:30, source-only normalizer, selected EMPTY head) for all 13 official held-in and held-out dataset tags. Online path is a 50-bin causal window with output /5, unit mask, full-window forward (no cross-window KV reuse), and no test-time adaptation.",
